msgid "Turnkey Companion Computer Solutions"
msgstr "开箱即用的伴飞计算机解决方案"

#: ../../source/docs/turnkey-companion-computer-solutions.rst:7
#: 138a371c07ad47a090e33ce829c85b19
msgid ""
"This article lists turnkey companion computer solutions that are advertised "
"as working with ArduPilot. These are typically commercially produced and "
"tuned variations of open source solutions like BeagleBoard, ODroid, "
"Raspberry Pi etc."
msgstr ""
"本文列出了宣称可与 ArduPilot 配合使用的开箱即用伴飞计算机解决方案。这些通常是基于 BeagleBoard、ODroid、Raspberry "
"Pi 等开源方案进行商业化生产和调优的衍生产品。"

#: ../../source/docs/turnkey-companion-computer-solutions.rst:11
#: 518e32a675d144a3847862a138b762d9
msgid ""
"Please let us know if you discover a new companion computer, so we can add "
"it to this list."
msgstr "如果您发现新的伴飞计算机，欢迎告知我们，以便将其添加到此列表中。"

#: ../../source/docs/turnkey-companion-computer-solutions.rst:14
#: de64153bd8c64060b1bd20743e133bf4
msgid "Horizon31 - PixC4-Jetson"
msgstr "Horizon31 - PixC4-Jetson"

#: ../../source/docs/turnkey-companion-computer-solutions.rst:19
#: 6816fc32cb044f449c052e80b217989a
msgid ""
"The `PixC4-Jetson <https://horizon31.com/product/pixc4-jetson/>`__ is a "
"professional-quality NDAA Compliant Flight Management Unit (FMUv5) which "
"supports ArduPilot and is tightly integrated with an Nvidia Jetson (Nano, "
"Xavier NX or TX2 NX) SBC and peripheral support system (USB, MIPI, Ethernet,"
" M.2 slot, etc.). The PixC4-Jetson is 83x59mm and features a board-to-board "
"design for direct integration into user platforms or can be used with "
"specialized \"breakout\" boards to support various vehicle types and wiring "
"needs."
msgstr ""
"`PixC4-Jetson <https://horizon31.com/product/pixc4-jetson/>`__ 是一款符合 NDAA "
"要求的专业级飞行管理单元（FMUv5），支持 ArduPilot，并与 Nvidia Jetson（Nano、Xavier NX 或 TX2 "
"NX）单板计算机及外设支持系统（USB、MIPI、以太网、M.2 插槽等）深度集成。PixC4-Jetson 尺寸为 "
"83x59mm，采用板对板设计，可直接集成到用户平台，也可搭配专用 「扩展板」 支持多种飞行器类型和布线需求。"

