#: ../../source/docs/turnkey-companion-computer-solutions.rst:35
#: 1d84cfd1dda44bd0a9cf74071a5a4f1f
msgid "Horizon31 - PixC4-Pi"
msgstr "Horizon31 - PixC4-Pi"

#: ../../source/docs/turnkey-companion-computer-solutions.rst:40
#: a279b8927e2741bbae2b8484ff7213b8
msgid ""
"The `PixC4-Pi <https://horizon31.com/product/pixc4-pi/>`__ is a "
"professional-quality NDAA Compliant Flight Management Unit (FMUv5) which "
"supports ArduPilot and is tightly integrated with a Raspberry Pi 4 compute "
"module and peripheral support system (USB, MIPI, Ethernet, M.2 slot, etc.). "
"The PixC4-Pi is about the size of a business card (84x42mm) and weighs 67g "
"(with heatsink). The PixC4-Pi includes the same software stack as the "
"PixC4-Jetson, with the primary difference being the PixC4-Pi does not "
"support h.265 encoding, only h.264."
msgstr ""
"`PixC4-Pi <https://horizon31.com/product/pixc4-pi/>`__ 是一款符合 NDAA "
"要求的专业级飞行管理单元（FMUv5），支持 ArduPilot，并与 Raspberry Pi 4 "
"计算模块及外设支持系统（USB、MIPI、以太网、M.2 插槽等）深度集成。PixC4-Pi 尺寸约为名片大小（84x42mm），重量 "
"67g（含散热片）。PixC4-Pi 包含与 PixC4-Jetson 相同的软件栈，主要区别在于 PixC4-Pi 不支持 h.265 编码，仅支持 "
"h.264。"

