#: cb082e00f2914232a27dd591af1c2189
msgid ""
"The ArduPilot dev team advise that this product may not be as \"turnkey\" as"
" indicated below. Community reports indicate that the Kit does not include "
"the LTE module and may also not supply a powering mechanism."
msgstr "ArduPilot 开发团队提示，该产品可能并非如下文所述那样 「开箱即用」。社区反馈表明，套件不含 LTE 模块，也可能不附带供电机构。"

#: ../../source/docs/turnkey-companion-computer-solutions.rst:86
#: 2dd9c4e9889c467ca17e965789cc56d2
msgid ""
"`4Gmetry <http://4gmetry.voltarobots.com/>`__ (Volta Robots) is a plug&play "
"companion computer kit, based on Odroid XU4 single board computer."
msgstr ""
"`4Gmetry <http://4gmetry.voltarobots.com/>`__（Volta Robots）是一款基于 Odroid XU4 "
"单板计算机的即插即用伴飞计算机套件。"

#: ../../source/docs/turnkey-companion-computer-solutions.rst:88
#: a88d94b41ea844639191cc609be8226b
msgid ""
"4Gmetry gets telemetry (MavLink) from the Autopilot and streams it over 4G "
"internet to a remote control station. 4Gmetry is fully compatible with Volta"
" OS to remotely manage fleets of robots via a simple high level API. 4Gmetry"
" can be used for computer vision tasks and video/image streaming over "
"internet. 4Gmetry comes ready to connect to your VPN, for safety/security "
"purposes; this also allows you remote console access (e.g. SSH)."
msgstr ""
"4Gmetry 从自动驾驶仪获取遥测数据（MAVLink），并通过 4G 互联网将其流式传输到远程控制站。4Gmetry 与 Volta OS "
"完全兼容，可通过简单的高级 API 远程管理机器人机队。4Gmetry 可用于计算机视觉任务及视频/图像的网络流传输。4Gmetry 开箱即可连接到您的"
" VPN，以保障安全；同时支持远程控制台访问（如 SSH）。"

